#. はい
msgctxt "0001 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0002 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 23>Rời khỏi đây?\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>ここはトラッシュルーム…つまりゴミ捨て場だな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is the trash room. The dump, in other words.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そう言えば、掃除当番の話はどうなったんだ？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That reminds me... Whatever happened to that whole\n"
"\"rotating cleaning duty\" thing?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Nhắc mới nhớ... Vụ phân chia \"trực nhật luân phiên\" kia\n"
"bị ra sao rồi nhỉ?\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>鉄格子の開閉スイッチだ…
#. 開けるのには鍵がいる…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's the switch to open and close the gate. You need a\n"
"key to activate it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>その鍵って今は誰が持ってるんだろう…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I wonder who has that key...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0008 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0009 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 23>Rời khỏi đây?\n"
"<CLT>"
